eight=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 129.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.0 36.7 36.7 43.4 43.4 59.2 59.2 75.7 82.4 102.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 82.4 90.0 90.0 102.0 113.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bir çöldeki seraba benzer. - Uzakta yaldırar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"167\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 167.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 45.7 45.7 56.3 56.3 63.0 63.0 72.0 72.0 82.4 90.0 105.7 105.7 112.4 112.4 131.3 131.3 144.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 72.0 119.3 119.3 144.0 150.7\" y=\"26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> imrenir, ihtiras ile koşar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"244\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 244.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 36.7 57.0 57.0 63.7 63.7 72.7 72.7 85.6 101.3 101.3 110.3 126.7 126.7 133.6 140.3 140.3 147.0 168.0 174.7 182.3 182.3 198.0 198.0 209.3 209.3 209.3 216.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 85.6 110.3 133.6 147.0 174.7 216.0 228.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> vaktâ ki ona varır onu hiç bir şey bulmaz-içini yakmakta olan harareti teskin edecek hakıkî suyu bulamadığı gibi uzaktan tevehhüm ettiği parıltı da kalmaz. Koştuğu emelin yalan olduğu tehakkuk eder. Fakat bununla da kalmaz. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 147.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 32.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 57.0 63.7 63.7 63.7 70.6 78.0 93.7 102.7 114.7 123.0\" 